{
  "sections": {
    "breadcrumbs": {
      "type": "breadcrumbs",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "text_alignment": "start",
        "padding_top": 16,
        "padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "blocks": {
        "ss_badge": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<span class=\"ss-pdp-badge\">Le cœur du rituel Home</span>"
          }
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "ss_pills": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ss-pdp-pills\"><span>Inspiré des sources thermales coréennes</span><span>Filtre 2-en-1 : sédiments + soin</span><span>3 à 4 semaines de rituel</span></div>"
          }
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "price",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "ss_facts": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ss-pdp-facts\"><div><b>Compatibilité</b>Coque de diffusion Home (Grand format)</div><div><b>Fonctionnement</b>Une couche retient les sédiments, puis la capsule thermale enrichit l&#x27;eau</div><div><b>Durée d&#x27;utilisation</b>3 à 4 semaines selon ta fréquence de douche</div></div>"
          }
        },
        "variant_picker": {
          "type": "variant_picker",
          "settings": {
            "picker_type": "button",
            "swatch_type": "shopify_swatch",
            "swatch_style": "circle",
            "swatch_size": 32,
            "button_style": "normal",
            "size_title": "Size",
            "size_chart_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "ss_offers": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-offers', product: product, section_id: section.id, tiers: '1:0,2:5,4:10', singular: \"filtre\", plural: \"filtres\", title: \"Choisis ta quantité\" %}"
          }
        },
        "buy_buttons": {
          "type": "buy_buttons",
          "settings": {
            "show_quantity_selector": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout": false,
            "show_gift_card_recipient": false
          }
        },
        "reassurance": {
          "type": "icon-with-text",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "vertical",
            "title_font": "body",
            "title_size": "text-base",
            "icon_1": "check",
            "heading_1": "<strong>Sélection Sunsoari</strong> : marques choisies avec exigence",
            "icon_2": "truck",
            "heading_2": "<strong>Livraison suivie</strong> en France métropolitaine",
            "icon_3": "check",
            "heading_3": "<strong>Paiement sécurisé</strong> : CB, Apple Pay, PayPal"
          }
        },
        "acc_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Description",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>En Corée, les sources thermales font partie des rituels de soin depuis des siècles. Onsha s'en inspire dans un filtre 2-en-1 : l'eau traverse d'abord une couche qui retient les sédiments, puis la capsule thermale qui l'enrichit et la parfume.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        },
        "acc_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Conseils d'utilisation",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Ouvre la coque de diffusion Home, retire le filtre usagé, insère le nouveau et referme. Quelques secondes, sans outil.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        },
        "acc_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Composition",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Filtration mécanique des sédiments et capsule thermale : eau thermale soufrée lyophilisée concentrée 4 fois (donnée de la marque), vitamine C, acide hyaluronique, glycérine, MSM et senteur. La liste INCI complète de chaque senteur figure sur l'emballage.</p><p>Usage externe uniquement, dans le système Onsha Home compatible. Tenir hors de portée des enfants. Conçu en Corée.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        },
        "sticky_atc": {
          "type": "sticky-atc-bar",
          "settings": {
            "visibility": "all",
            "style": "minimalist",
            "container": "full",
            "show_atc_button": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout_buttons": false,
            "show_quantity": true
          }
        },
        "ss_addon_1": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-addon', addon: all_products['coque-de-diffusion'], variant_title: \"Grand format\", kind: 'indispensable', title: \"Pas encore équipée ? Ajoute :\", note: \"La coque Home qui accueille et maintient ton filtre. À acheter une seule fois.\", section_id: section.id %}"
          }
        },
        "ss_addon_2": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-addon', addon: all_products['pommeau-de-douche-filtrant'], variant_title: \"\", kind: 'complement', title: \"\", note: \"La pomme de douche filtrante qui se visse sur la coque.\", section_id: section.id %}"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ss_badge",
        "title",
        "ss_pills",
        "price",
        "description",
        "variant_picker",
        "ss_offers",
        "ss_addon_1",
        "ss_addon_2",
        "buy_buttons",
        "ss_facts",
        "reassurance",
        "acc_1",
        "acc_2",
        "acc_3",
        "sticky_atc"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        "@media (min-width: 1280px) {.product {padding-inline: 5rem; }}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "use_color_scheme_in_container": false,
        "enable_sticky_info": true,
        "media_size": "large",
        "gallery_layout": "vertical-carousel",
        "mobile_thumbnails": "show",
        "show_image_border": false,
        "enable_image_zoom": true,
        "enable_video_looping": true,
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
    "ss_steps": {
      "type": "ss-story",
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Ouvre</strong> la coque de diffusion Home."
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Retire</strong> le filtre usagé."
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Insère</strong> le nouveau filtre."
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Referme</strong> et fais couler l'eau."
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "b1",
        "b2",
        "b3",
        "b4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "layout": "steps",
        "background": "white",
        "align": "center",
        "eyebrow": "Mode d'emploi",
        "heading": "Remplace ton filtre en quelques secondes",
        "text": "",
        "columns": 3,
        "columns_mobile": "1",
        "ratio": "1/1",
        "open_first": false,
        "tip_title": "Les conseils de l'équipe",
        "tip_text": "<p>Garde un filtre d'avance : 3 à 4 semaines passent vite. Le pack de 4 te permet d'explorer les quatre senteurs.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Comment_installer_la_recharge.gif"
      }
    },
